[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m Now, we need to find the units digit of 256. The units digit of a number is the remainder when the number is divided by 10. So, we can find the units digit of 256 by looking at the last digit of 256, which is 6.
