[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m    \]
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m 9. **Conclusion**: The prime factorization of $3328$ has been fully accounted for correctly.
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m 10. **Identify the largest prime factor**: From our prime factorization:
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m \[
