[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m <|im_start|>assistant
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m Let's first calculate the height difference between Yao Ming and Earl Boykins. Then, we'll convert this difference to inches.
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m Height difference:  (7'5'' - 5'5'') =  20"6'' - 30" = -10"4''"
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m Negative would be shorter than the taller player.
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m Next, let's convert the negative height difference into inches. There are 12 inches in a foot, and 2.54 cm in an inch.
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m Height difference in inches:  -10"4'' * 12" / 2.54" = 66.66 inches
