[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m First, let's use the given projection formula to form two equations:
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m 1. \(\operatorname{proj}_{\begin{pmatrix} 2 \\ 3 \end{pmatrix}} \mathbf{v} = \frac{\mathbf{v} \cdot \begin{pmatrix} 2 \\ 3 \end{pmatrix}}{\begin{pmatrix} 2 \\ 3 \end{pmatrix} \cdot \begin{pmatrix} 2 \\ 3 \end{pmatrix}} \begin{pmatrix} 2 \\ 3 \end{pmatrix} = \begin{pmatrix} \frac{58}{13} \\ \frac{87}{13} \end{pmatrix}\)
