[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m Step 3: Complete the process
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m 3! = 6 different possible orders in which Harry, Ron, and Neville can finish.
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m 
