[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m idea:
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m We have $\dbinom{n}{k}$, some adjacent logic to my idea will be $\dbinom{n,k}\anda\left(\dbinom{n-1}{k}\right)$.
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m Code:
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m \begin{aligned} \dbinom{n}{1}&=\dbinom{n}{n-1}=1\\ \dbinom{n}{n}&=\dbinom{n}{0}=1\\ \left(\dbinom{n-1}{k}\right)&=\dbinom{n-1}{n-1-k}=1 \end{aligned}
