[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m Below is the graph of $y = a \cos bx$ for some positive constants $a$ and $b.$  Find $b.$
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m [asy]import TrigMacros;
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m size(400);
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m real g(real x)
