[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m    \]
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m    Count these integers:
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m    \[
