[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m Let $f(x)$ and $g(x)$ be odd functions.  Is $f(x) g(x)$ even, odd, or neither?
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m Enter "odd", "even", or "neither".
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m Please reason step by step, and put your final answer within \boxed{{}}.<|im_end|>
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m <|im_start|>assistant
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m To determine whether the function $f(x) g(x)$ is even, odd, or neither, we need to analyze the properties of the odd functions $f(x)$ and $g(x)$. 
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m 1. Definition of an odd function: A function $h(x)$ is odd if $h(-x) = -h(x)$ for all $x$ in the domain of $h$.
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m 2. Defining the odd functions on $f(x)$ and $g(x)$:
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m    - Since $f(x)$ is an odd function, we have $f(-x) = -f(x)$ for all $x$ in the domain of $f$.
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m    - Since $g(x)$ is an odd function, we have $g(-x) = -g(x)$ for all $x$ in the domain of $g$.
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m 3. Considering $f(x) g(x)$:
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m    - We know that $f(x)$ and $g(x)$ are odd functions.
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m    - The product of two odd functions, $f(x) g(x)$, means that the product of $f(x)$ and $g(x)$ is an even function.
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m 4. Conclusion:
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m    - Since $f(x) g(x)$ is an even function and we have derived that it is equal to the product of two odd functions, $f(x) g(x)$ must also be an even function.
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m Therefore, the final answer is:
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m $$ \boxed{\text{even}} $$<|endoftext|>
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m [Ground Truth]
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m \text{even}
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m [Is Boxed Matched]
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m True
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m 
