[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m We learn that $LCD$ is coprime with numerator as well as $LCD$ is $2x^2+5x-1$. Furthermore, since we wish 
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m to find the quotient, we can set up a polynomial division problem.
