[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m We are given that the box is a rectangular prism. Its volume is \(240\) cubic units when the three sides are \(a\), \(b\), and \(c\) respectively, where \(c < b < a\). The side lengths are \(a\) and \(b\), and \(c\) is an integer.
