[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m $$|x + y - 1| + \Big| |x| - x \Big| + \Big| |x - 1| + x - 1 \Big| = 0$$
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m $$\begin{cases} x + y - 1 & \ge 0 \\ x + y - 1 & \le 0 \\ x - 1 & \le 0 \end{cases}$$
