[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m I will convert the problem into a mathematical equation and solve it using Python code.              
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m Each row in the Misty Moon Amphitheater has 33 seats.
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m Rows 12 through 22 are reserved for a youth club.
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m To find the number of seats reserved for the youth club:
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m Since the youth club seats are in rows 12 through 22;
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m The number of seats reserved for the youth club in those rows is 22 - 12 = 10.
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m Hence, the total number of seats reserved for the youth club is 10 * 33 = 330.
