[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m    192y^2 + 72y + 81 + 9 \left( 48 - 3 \right) = 8
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m    \]
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m    \[
