[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m    \[
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m    192y^2 + 72y + 400 = 0
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m    \]
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m    Dividing by 32:
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m    \[
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m    6y^2 + 2.25y + 12.5 = 0
