[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m For the first equation \((2x^3 + x^2 - 8x + 20)(5x^3 - 25x^2 + 19) = 0\), we set each factor equal to zero and solve for \(x\):
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m 
