[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m 2. \(5x^3 - 25x^2 + 19 = 0\)
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m These equations are even more complex. Let's solve them numerically to find the roots:
