[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m This gives us \(\sin 2sx = 0\), so \(2x = k\pi\) for \(k \in \mathbb{Z}\), or \(x = \frac{k\pi}{2}\) for \(k \in \mathbb{Z}\). Evaluating \(\sin^4 x\) at these points, we get:
