[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m    The circle centered at $O$ with radius $1$ unit.
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m 2. **Point \(D\):**
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m    \(D\) is the center of the circle such that \(AD\) is the diameter. So, \(D\) is at \((1,0)\).
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m 3. **Right Triangle Properties:**
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m    \[
