[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m    \]
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m    Now, since \(A\) is at \(\left(\frac{\sqrt{3}}{2}, 0\right)\), use the distance formula to find \(AO\):
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m    \[
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m    AO = \sqrt{\left(\frac{\sqrt{3}}{2} - 1\right)^2 + 0^2} = \sqrt{\frac{1 + 3}{4}} = \frac{2}{2} = 1
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m    \]
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m 
