[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m \[ a \neq c \]
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m For \( a = 50 - 10\sqrt{5} \) and \( c = 29 - (50 - 10\sqrt{\sqrt{5}}) \):
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m 
