[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m    \dfrac{ 40 }{ 90 } : \dfrac{ 8 }{ 97 }
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m    \]
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m 4. Simplify by dividing the numerators and denominators by their GCD:
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m    - GCD of 40 and 90 is 10, and we divide by 10 in both fractions:
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m      \[
