[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m ### Ratio 3: \(\dfrac{ 11 }{ 20 } : \dfrac{ 20 }{ 37 } \)
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m 1. Find the LCD of 20 and 37.
