[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m What is the value of $x$ if \begin{align*}x &= y+5,\\
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m y &= z+10,\\
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m z &= w+20,\\
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m \text{and }\qquad w &= 80?
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m \end{align*}
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m Please reason step by step, and put your final answer within \boxed{{}}.<|im_end|>
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m <|im_start|>assistant
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m To solve for $x$ in the first equation, we add $y$ and $w$ together:
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m \begin{align*}
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m     x &= y + 5 \\
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m     x &= (z + 10) + (w + 20) \\
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m     x &= z + 10 + w + 20 \\
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m     x &= z + w + 30
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m \end{align*}
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m Since we know that $z = w + 20$, we can substitute this to simplify:
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m \begin{align*}
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m     x &= (w + 20) + w + 30 \\
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m     x &= 2w + 50
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m \end{align*}
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m Now we have $x$ in terms of $w$:
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m \begin{align*}
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m     x &= 2w + 50
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m \end{align*}
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m Next, we substitute the unknown $w$ into the equation $x = 2w + 50$ to find $x$:
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m \begin{align*}
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m     x &= 2(80) + 50 \\
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m     x &= 160 + 50 \\
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m     x &= 210
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m \end{align*}
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m Therefore, the value of $x$ is \boxed{210}. endforeachinstancetype
