[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m ### Step 1: Assigning the 5 male roles
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m To assign 5 male roles to 5 men, it must be done such that for each man: the number of men choosing a specific role must be equal to the number of women choosing the same role. This implies a permutation problem where no bonds are present yet, and we must distribute the blocks (5 men and 5 roles per block) without considering sequence due to the permutation of the roles around the matrix.
