[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m \[\text{Multiples in same group:} 6!\]
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m #### Case 2: No duplicates
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m We have to consider permutations of how each role can be chosen by men for women, considering duplicates.
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m Rewriting our initial permutation setup:
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m 1. Assign roles with by type.
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m 2. Subtract the overcounting due to duplicate roles.
