[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m Find the units digit of $29 \cdot 79 + 31 \cdot 81$.
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m Please reason step by step, and put your final answer within \boxed{{}}.<|im_end|>
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m <|im_start|>assistant
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m To find the units digit of the expression \( 29 \cdot 79 + 31 \cdot 81 \), we will need to focus only on the units digits of the individual terms involved, because the factors 29 and 79 have the same last digits, as do the factors 31 and 81. 
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m 1. **Find the units digit of 29:**
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m    \[
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m    29 \rightarrow 9
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m    \]
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m    So the units digit of \(29 \cdot 79\) is 9.
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m 2. **Find the units digit of 79:**
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m    \[
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m    79 \rightarrow 9
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m    \]
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m    So the units digit of \(79 \cdot 31\) is 9.
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m 3. **Find the units digit of 31:**
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m    \[
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m    31 \rightarrow 1
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m    \]
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m    So the units digit of \(31 \cdot 81\) (concatenating \(31\) and \(81\)) is the same as the units digit of \(1 \cdot 81\) (by convention), which is 1.
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m 4. **Combine the results and find the units digit of \(9 + 1\):**
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m    \[
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m    9 + 1 = 10
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m    \]
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m    The units digit of \(10\) is 0.
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m Thus, the units digit of the expression \( 29 \cdot 79 + 31 \cdot 81 \) is \boxed{0}.<|endoftext|>
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m 
