[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m To determine the common ratio of this geometric sequence, we can follow these steps:
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m 1. Identify the initial term of the sequence. The first term \( a \) is 16.
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m 2. Identify the third term of the sequence. The third term \( a_3 \) is -24.
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m 3. Identify the fourth term of the sequence. The fourth term \( a_4 \) is 36.
