[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m x^2 - 14x + 1/4 = k - 12 + 1/4
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m (x - 7/2)^2 = k - 11.5
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m Since we know that k = 12k, we can substitute 12k into the equation:
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m (x - 7/2)^2 = 12k - 11.5
