[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m Let $v$, $w$, $x$, $y$, and $z$ be the degree measures of the five angles of a pentagon.  Suppose $v<w<x<y<z$ and $v$, $w$, $x$, $y$, and $z$ form an arithmetic sequence. Find the value of $x$.
