[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m 1. We know that the angles \(v\), \(w\), \(x\), \(y\), and \(z\) form an arithmetic sequence.
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m 2. Also, we know that \(v < w < x < y < z\) and these angles sum up to 360°. So, we can write:
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m    \[
