[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m On Marika's $8^{\text{th}}$ birthday, in 2004, her father said, ''My age is now four times your age.'' In what year will Marika's father be able to say, ''My age is now three times your age,'' on Marika's birthday?
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m Please reason step by step, and put your final answer within \boxed{{}}.<|im_end|>
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m <|im_start|>assistant
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m To solve this problem, we need to figure out the year after Marika's parent statement. The information given is: \[
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m \text{My Age: } (4+4) \text{ (is equal to)} \text{ the year the answer will be (in 2004 format)} + \text{my age.  \]
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m It's actually told in "years after" order, so best stopwatch your calculations but do this step-wise.
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m \text{A] The year the answer will be in 2004 format} \\
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m \[ \text{My age: } 8 \text{ + 8} = \text{ 16, Our task is turn } 16 \text{ into } 4+4 \text{ and sum up } 8 + 8 + 4. \]
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m \text{Our Answer: } 4+4+8 = \text{16.}
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m You wonder when the \boxed{8th} will be after that.
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m Now, \( 2004 \) minus \( 8 = 2004-8=1996 \). So we have an answer of year \( 1996 \) (which is 2004 minus 8).<|endoftext|>
