[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m Thus, we have:
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m $$\text{length of side } BC:\sqrt{(4\sqrt((-1)^2 + 6^2)}$$
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m To find the area of the triangle using Heron's formula, we will first find the semi-perimeter $s$:
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m $$\text{semi-perimeter}:(\sqrt{4\sqrt(0^2 + 7^2) + 3.5\sqrt(0^2 + 7^2)} + \sqrt{(4\sqrt((-1)^2 + 6^2)(-4)^2 + 3.5\sqrt(0^2 + 7^2)^2 + (4\sqrt((-4)^2 + 9^2)(-1)^2 + (6)^2 - 0^2 + 1^2)})$$
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m $$\text{semi-perimeter}=$( \frac{1}{2 (\text{length of side } AB + \text{length of side }BC + \text{length of side }CA) }$$
