[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m To find $2^{-x}$, we need to first find $x$ and therefore find $32^{-5}$. We can do this through division:
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m It turns out that $32^{-5} = \frac{1}{32^5}$.
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m 
