[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m The volume of the parallelepiped generated by $\begin{pmatrix} 2 \\ 3 \\ 4 \end{pmatrix},$ $\begin{pmatrix} 1 \\ k \\ 2 \end{pmatrix},$ and $\begin{pmatrix} 1 \\ 2 \\ k \end{pmatrix}$ is 15.  Find $k,$ where $k > 0.$
