[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m Where $e$ is Euler's number with a value of approximately:
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m $$\color{red}{e = 2.71828 \cdots}$$
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m To find the value of this expression, we can use Euler's formulae:
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m $$e^{ix} = \cos(x) + i\sin(x)$$
