[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m $x + 2y + z = 4$
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m We want to find the maximum value of:
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m $xy + xz + yz$
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m To find this maximum value, we can define a new variable \(t\):
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m $t = x + 2y + z$
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m From the given equation, we can express \(x + z\) in terms of \(t\) using the equation:
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m $x + 2y + z = 4 \implies x + z = 4 - 2y \implies t - 2y = 4 - 2y \implies t = 4$
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m Substituting \(t = 4\) into the equations:
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m $x + 2y + z = 4$
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m $x + y + z = 4$
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m Solving these equations for \(x + z\) and \(x \cdot z\):
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m $x + z = 4 - 2y$
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m $x + (4 - 2y) = 4 \implies x = 4 - 2y$
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m \(y + z = 4 - 2x \implies y + (4 - 2(4 - 2y)) = 4 - 2(4 - 2y) \implies y + 4 - 8 + 4y = -16 + 4y \implies y = -10\)
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m Given \(y - z = 2\), we have:
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m \(y = 5\) and \(z = -3\)
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m Now, substitute \(x\), \(y\), and \(z\) into the expression \(xy + xz + yz\):
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m \(xy + xz + yz = x(5) + x(-3) + y(-3) = 5x - 3x - 3y = 2x - 3y\)
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m \(2x - 3y = 2(5) - 3(5) = 10 - 15 = -5\)
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m 
