[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m There are two different isosceles triangles whose side lengths are integers and whose areas are $120.$ One of these two triangles, $\triangle XYZ,$ is shown. Determine the perimeter of the second triangle.
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m 
