[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m Expanding the left-hand side:
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m \[3x - 15 \le 7\]
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m Next, isolate the term with the \(x\)-variable:
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m 
