[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m 2. \(b_{n+1}=a_n+b_n-\sqrt{a_n^2+b_n^2}\)
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m Step 2: Verify the initial condition
