[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m b. To simplify the fractions, we can rationalize by multiplying the numerator and denominator by the conjugate of the denominator:
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m     - \(\frac{1}{-1 + \sqrt{2010}} \cdot \frac{\sqrt{2010} - \sqrt{2010}}{\sqrt{2010} - \sqrt{2010}} = -\sqrt{2010} + \sqrt{2010}\)
