[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m After simplifying each product, we have:
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m \[\left( 1 + \cos \frac {\pi}{8} \right) \left( 1 + \cos \frac {3 \pi}{8} \right) \left( 1 + \cos \frac {5 \pi}{8} \right) \left( 1 + \cos \frac {7 \pi}{8} \right) = 1 + \cos \frac {7 \pi}{8} + \cos \frac {7 \pi}{4} + \cos \frac {5 \pi}{4} - \frac{1}{2} - \cos \frac {3 \pi}{4} - \cos \frac {5 \pi}{4} + \cos \frac {7 \pi}{8} = 1 + \cos \frac {7 \pi}{8} - \frac{3}{2}\]
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m Since $\cos \frac {7 \pi}{2} = \cos \frac {3 \pi}{2} = -1$, we have:
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m $1 + 2\cos \frac {3 \pi}{8} + 1 = 2 + \cos \frac {3 \pi}{8}$
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m Note that:
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m $\cos \frac {3 \pi}{8} = \cos \left( \frac {\pi}{4} + \frac {\pi}{8} \right) = \cos \frac {\pi}{4} \cos \frac {\pi}{8} - \sin \frac {\pi}{4} \sin \frac {\pi}{8} = \frac {\sqrt {2}}{2} \left( \frac {\sqrt {2} - \sqrt {2} \sin \frac {\pi}{2}}{2} + \frac {\sqrt {2}}{2} \sqrt {2} \cos \frac {\pi}{2} \right) = 0$
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m Therefore, the final expression simplifies to:
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m $2 - \frac {\sqrt {2}}{2}$<|endoftext|>
