[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m ```
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m The single-digit replacements that make the number 24z38 divisible by 6 are 1, 3, and 4. The sum of these digits is:
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m 
