[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m = x^6(x^3 - 2x^2 + Dx - 2D) + B - x^8D - 4D^6x - D^9x + 8D^6x^5 - 64D^4x^3x^4 - 16D^2x^4x^4 - 512D^3x^3 + 16D^2x^6
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m Since the \(x^3\) term and the term with \(x^5\) cancel out, we have:
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m = B + D
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m So the remainder is \( B + D \).
