[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m A 6 cm by 8 cm rectangle is inscribed in a circle. What is the number of centimeters in the circumference of the circle? Express your answer in terms of $\pi$.
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m [asy]import graph;
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m defaultpen(linewidth(0.7));
