[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m Now, we wish to find \(\mathbf{A} + 8 \mathbf{A}^{-1}\). First, we isolate \(\mathbf{A}^{-1}\) from the equation. From \(\mathbf{A}^2 = 6 \mathbf{A} - 8 \mathbf{I}\), we can factor out \(\mathbf{A}\):
