[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m Since \( \mathbf{A}^{-1} - 6 \mathbf{A}^{-1} = -5 \mathbf{A}^{-1} \), we can substitute back into the equation:
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m \mathbf{A} (-5 \mathbf{A}^{-1}) = -8 \mathbf{I},
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m which simplifies to:
