[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m -5 \mathbf{A} \mathbf{A}^{-1} = -8 \mathbf{I}.
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m Since \(\mathbf{A} \mathbf{A}^{-1}\) is just the inverse of \(\mathbf{A}\) (i.e., \(\mathbf{A}^{-1} = \frac{1}{\mathbf{A}}\)), we have:
