[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m We know that $a$, $b$, and $c$ are positive real numbers, and $\frac{1}{a+b}+\frac{1}{a+c}+\frac{1}{b+c}\geq 3\sqrt[3]{\frac{1}{(a+b)(a+c)(b+c)}}$. Therefore,
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m \frac{a+b+c}{\left(\frac{1}{a+b}+\frac{1}{a+c}+\frac{1}{b+c}\right)}\geq 3.
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m Thus,
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m a+b+c\left(\frac{1}{a+b}+\frac{1}{a+c}+\frac{1}{b+c}\right)\geq 3\left(\frac{1}{a+b}+\frac{1}{a+c}+\frac{1}{b+c}\right).
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m By the Mean Value Theorem and AM-GM inequality, we have
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m \frac{\frac{1}{a+b}+\frac{1}{a+c}+\frac{1}{b+c}}{3}\geq \frac{3}{a+b+c}.
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m Equality holds if and only if $a=b=c$.
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m 
