[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m    (x - (\frac{\sqrt{2}}{p} + \frac{\sqrt{3}}{pq}))(x - (\frac{\sqrt{2}}{p} + \frac{\sqrt{3}}{pq})) \cdot (x^2 + \age{+1} 2\sqrt{2} + \age{+1} 3 \sqrt{3} + k \ledqrm)x^3
