[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m Determine the average of the integers $71,$ $72,$ $73,$ $74,$ $75.$
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m Please reason step by step, and put your final answer within \boxed{{}}.<|im_end|>
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m <|im_start|>assistant
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m To calculate the average of the integers $71,$ $72,$ $73,$ $74,$ $75,$ we will perform the following steps:
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m 1. **Sum all the integers:** Add the given integers together.
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m    \[
