[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m If a certain number is multiplied by five, the result is the  same as twenty-one plus twice the original number.  What is the value of the original number?
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m Please reason step by step, and put your final answer within \boxed{{}}.<|im_end|>
