[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m What integer $n$ satisfies $0\le n<19$ and $$-200\equiv n\pmod{19}~?$$
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m Please reason step by step, and put your final answer within \boxed{{}}.<|im_end|>
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m <|im_start|>assistant
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m When $ -200 \equiv n \pmod {19}$, it means $ -200 \mod{19} = n$.
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m ### 定义:
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m 我们要判断 $ -200 \mod 19$ 是否等于某个 表示式 $n$ 的值.
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m ### 解答:
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m 令 $k= -200$ , $m=19$ .
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m 因为 $ \mathop{\text{gcd} }{ k,\,m=1} $, 令 $\varphi := \mathop{\text{gcd} }{k ,m-1} $.
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m 因为 $\varphi |k$ , 那么 $\varphi =1$ , $\implies k = \varphi \cdot m -1 \implies n = \varphi \cdot m$
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m 根据 $n \in {0,\,18}$ 逐个比较 $0 \le n < 18$ , 计算 !:
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m $$\begin{aligned}n &= \varphi \cdot m\\ 0&= \varphi =2*17-1\\ 1&= 8*17-1\\ 2&=16*17-1 \\ 3&=14*17-1\\ 4&=12*17-1\\ 5&=10*17-1\\ 6&=8*17-1\\ 7&=6*17-1\\ 8&=4*17-1\\ 9&=2*17-1 \\ 10&=1*17-1\\11&=11-1\\12&=0\\13&=0\\14&=0\\15&=0\\16&=0\\17&=0\\18&=0\\ \end{aligned}$$
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m 所以 $0\le n< 19$ , 即 $n = 1$ $\iff$ $0\le 1 < 18$ .
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m 所以 $\boxed{n = 1}$<|endoftext|>
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m 
