[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m     - The reciprocal of the reciprocal of $\frac{5}{6}$ is $\frac{5}{6}$.
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m 2. **Divide the reciprocal of $\frac{5}{6}$ by the reciprocal of the reciprocal of $\frac{5}{6}$:**
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m     - Divide $\frac{6}{5}$ by $\frac{5}{6}$.
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m 3. **Perform the division:**
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m     - Dividing is equivalent to multiplying by the reciprocal, so 
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m       \[
