[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m A box contains 5 white balls and 6 black balls.  Five balls are drawn out of the box at random.  What is the probability that they all are white?
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m Please reason step by step, and put your final answer within \boxed{{}}.<|im_end|>
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m <|im_start|>assistant
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m Yes, I can help you with that! To calculate the probability that all five balls drawn out of the box are white, we need to use combinations and permutations. In this scenario, we can consider splitting our problem into two parts: drawing from the white balls and drawing from the black balls.
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m Step 1: Total number of balls drawn from the box is 5 (white balls) + 6 (black balls) = 11 balls.
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m Step 2: To get one white ball, there is only 1 way to draw it. After that, again there is only 1 way to draw a white ball. We continue this process until the 5th transfer, after which there will be no more white balls to draw. The number of ways to draw this 5th ball from the box is therefore 1, as we don't have any white balls left.
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m Step 3: Since each ball has the same chance of being drawn (b sircimact = prob(white = 1/11)),
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m the total number of ways to draw all 5 white balls from the box is 1 way (white combination).
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m Step 4: The total number of possible outcomes (drawings from all 11 balls) is 11^5.
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m This can be calculated using the formula for permutations: \( P(N,a) = N! / (N - a)! \), where \( N \) is the number of items, \( a \) is the number of items to exclude (in this case, 5 white balls, so \( a = 5 \)).
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m Step 5: So, the total number of possible outcomes is \( P(11,5) = 208160 \).
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m 
