[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m Let's do the calculation to ensure everything checks out:
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m ```python
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m # Substitute s with (32 - r) to find s
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m regular_packs_value = 32 - 8
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m 
