[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m $x = 1$
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m The smaller odd integer is 1. The larger odd integer is $x + 2 = 1 + 2 = 3$.
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m Thus, the sum of the two consecutive odd integers is $1 + 3 = 4$.
