[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m so the first cross product \(\mathbf{c} \times \mathbf{a}\) is zero:
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m \[ \mathbf{c} \times \mathbf{a} = \mathbf{0} \]
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m Since the second cross product \(\mathbf{c} \times \mathbf{b}\) is also 0:
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m \[ \mathbf{c} \times \mathbf{b} = \mathbf{0} \]
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m Thus:
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m \[ \mathbf{c} \times (3 \mathbf{a} - 2 \mathbf{b}) = 3 (\mathbf{c} \times \mathbf{a}) - 2 (\mathbf{c} \times \mathbf{b}) = 3 \cdot 0 - 2 \cdot 0 = \mathbf{0} \]
