[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m Certainly! Below is a simple worksheet designed to introduce a concept in the context of starting at edge A and crossing the river to start fishing later, using a classic off-scroll legend to serve as a prompt. This is a straightforward, step-based practice that enhances reading and comprehension skills.
