[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m 3. Continue the division with the next number, 5:
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m 5 \div 7 = [0, 0, 5, 3] \Rightarrow [0, 0, 5, 8] \Rightarrow [0, 0, 5, 8]
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m 4. Continue with the next number, 12 (which equates to \(\frac{2 \times 7}{47}\) or \(0.\overline{5}\)):
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m 2 \div 7 = [0, 2, 0, 6] \Rightarrow [0, 2, 0, 6]
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m 
