[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m <|im_start|>assistant
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m Consider the equation:
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m $k - 2 = 2[ \log_{10}(k - 2) + \log_{10}(k - 1) + 1]$
