[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m $k - 2 \approx 2(68.58 + 1)$
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m $k - 2 \approx 2 \cdot 69.58$
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m $k - 2 \approx 139.16$
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m Since $k > 2$, we can round this up to the next integer greater than 2:
