[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m (150 / 60) x 26
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m Let's do the math:
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m 
