[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m Then:
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m 2.5 x 26 = 65
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m So, the athlete's heart beat 65 times during the 26-mile race.boxed{}<|endoftext|>
