[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m 2. **Shoe Store's Sale Plan:**
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m     - The shoe store has a sale every 6th day of July.
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m ### Separating Days of July:
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m 
