[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m - The bookstore and the shoe store have a sale on the same day exactly on venues at \( \text{7th} \text{ day} \) (1st day of July = 7).
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m ### Counting the Occurrences:
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m - The shoe store has a sale on July 3.
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m   
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m - Specifically, the shoe store's sale occurs on the 7th day of July.
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m 
