[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m \[ 1 \text{ sell on 7th} \]
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m \[ \text{7} \text{ appears once} \]
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m Putting it all together, our final answer is:
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m \boxed{1}
