[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m 2. **Calculate the sale dates for the store with a sale every 6 days on July 3:**
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m    - July specifically: 3, 6, 9, 12, 15, 18, 21, 24, 27, 30
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m    - July 3: (3, 6)
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m 3. **Find the common sale date within the same month:**
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m    - The common date among 3 and 6 is 6.
