[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m To evaluate $\left(\frac{i}{4}\right)^4$, we first need to raise $\frac{i}{4}$ to the power of 4. When raising a number to a negative exponent, the negative sign remains in front. So, we can rewrite the expression as:
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m 
