[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m Sandy plans to paint one wall in her bedroom. The wall is 9 feet high and 12 feet long. There is a 2-foot by 4-foot area on that wall that she will not have to paint due to the window. How many square feet will she need to paint?
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m Please reason step by step, and put your final answer within \boxed{{}}.<|im_end|>
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m <|im_start|>assistant
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m Sure, let's solve this step by step.
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m 1. **Calculate the total area of the wall where Sandy needs to paint:**
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m    The wall is 9 feet high and 12 feet long.
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m    
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m    \[
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m    \text{Total area} = \text{Length} \times \text{Height} = 12 \, \text{feet} \times 9 \, \text{feet}
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m    \]
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m    
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m    \[
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m    = 108 \, \text{square feet}
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m    \]
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m 2. **Subtract the area of the area on the window:**
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m    There is a 2-foot by 4-foot area on the wall that Sandy does not need to paint. To find the area on the wall for painting, we subtract this area from the total area:
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m    
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m    \[
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m    \text{Painted area} = \text{Total area} - \text{Area of window}
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m    \]
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m    
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m    \[
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m    = 108 \, \text{square feet} - 2 \, \text{square feet} \times 4 \, \text{feet}
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m    \]
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m    
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m    \[
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m    = 108 \, \text{square feet} - 8 \, \text{square feet}
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m    \]
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m    
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m    \[
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m    = 100 \, \text{square feet}
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m    \]
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m So, Sandy will need to paint \(\boxed{100}\) square feet.<|endoftext|>
