[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m One US dollar is the equivalent of 7 Namibian dollars.  One US dollar is also the equivalent of 6 Chinese yuan. If a painting costs 105 Namibian dollars, how much would it cost in Chinese yuan?
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m Please reason step by step, and put your final answer within \boxed{{}}.<|im_end|>
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m <|im_start|>assistant
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m To find out the cost of the painting in Chinese yuan, we need to follow these steps:
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m 1. Calculate the cost of the painting in Namibian dollars.
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m 2. Convert the result into Chinese yuan.
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m Step 1: Calculate the cost of the painting in Namibian dollars.
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m The painting costs 105 Namibian dollars, and we know that 1 US dollar is equivalent to 7 Namibian dollars.
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m $105 USD ÷ 7 USD per USD = 15 USD per Dollar
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m Now, convert 105 Namibian dollars to Namibian cents (1 USD = 100 Namibian cents)
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m 105 USD × 100 USD/1 Namibian cent = 10,500 Namibian cents
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m 10,500 Namibian cents ÷ 7 Namibian dollars = 1,500 Namibian dollars
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m Step 2: Convert the result into Chinese yuan.
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m One US dollar is also equivalent to 6 Chinese yuan.
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m 1,500 Namibian dollars × 6 Chinese yuan per USD = 9,000 Chinese yuan
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m So, if the painting costs 105 Namibian dollars, it would cost 9,000 Chinese yuan.
