[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m However, this directrix can vary based on \( c \).
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m So, in general, but assuming (h, k) is (0, k), the equation of the directrix is:
