[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m \[\frac{\left( x + \dfrac{1}{x} \right)^6 - \left( x^6 + \dfrac{1}{x^6} \right) - 2}{\left( x + \dfrac{1}{x} \right)^3 + \left( x^3 + \dfrac{1}{x^3} \right)}\]for $x > 0.$
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m Please reason step by step, and put your final answer within \boxed{{}}.<|im_end|>
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m <|im_start|>assistant
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m We are given to find the minimum value of
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m \[\frac{\left( x + \dfrac{1}{x} \right)^6 - \left( x^6 + \dfrac{1}{x^6} \right) - 2}{\left( x + \dfrac{1}{x} \right)^3 + \left( x^3 + \dfrac{1}{x^3} \right)}.\] Mathematically, we shall now lesion,  
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m \[\frac{\left( x + \dfrac{1}{x} \right)^6 - \left( x^6 + \dfrac{1}{x^6} \right) - 2}{\left( x + \dfrac{1}{x} \right)^3 + \left( x^3 + \dfrac{1}{x^3} \right)}\]  
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m Since, by the Southern difference multiplication theorem,  
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m \[\dfrac{x^6 + \dfrac{1}{x^6}}{\dfrac{x^3 + \dfrac{1}{x^3}}{3} + 1} = \dfrac{x^6 + \dfrac{1}{x^6}}{\dfrac{x^6 + \dfrac{1}{x^6}}{3}} = 3,\]  
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m we can now write  
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m \[x + \dfrac{1}{x} = \pm 3,\]  
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m and  
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m \[x^6 + \dfrac{1}{x^6} = \pm (3 \pm 2\sqrt{3}).\] Let us now each of them become non-negative by observing their squares.  The outcome is  
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m \[x^6 + \dfrac{1}{x^6} = 3^2 + 2\sqrt{3}^2 = 9 + 12 = 21\],  
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m and  
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m \[x^6 + \dfrac{1}{x^6} = - (3 \pm 2\sqrt{3})^2 + 2\sqrt{3}^2 = 21 + 24 - 12\sqrt{3}.\]  
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m Thus, the desired function can be written as 
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m $$
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m f(x) = \frac{\left( x + \dfrac{1}{x} \right)^6 - \left( x^6 + \dfrac{1}{x^6} \right) - 2}{\left( x + \dfrac{1}{x} \right)^3 + \left( x^3 + \dfrac{1}{x^3} \right)} = \frac{(3 + 2\sqrt{3})^3 - (-2)(9 + 2\sqrt{3} - 24)}{(3 - 2\sqrt{3})^3 + (-24 + 24)} = \frac{21 + 24\sqrt{3} + 72 - (-20\sqrt{3} + 12)}{(24 - 72 - 12\sqrt{3}) + 1} = \frac{33\sqrt{3} + 64}{-57\sqrt{3} - 6} = \frac{64 \cdot \sqrt{3} + 33}{-57\sqrt{3} - 6},$$  
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m and  
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m $$\left| f(x) \right| = \left| \frac{64 \cdot \sqrt{3} + 33}{-57\sqrt{3} - 6} \right| = \frac{33}{67\sqrt{3} + 6} = \frac{33(\sqrt{3} + 1)}{6} = \frac{33(\sqrt{3} + 1)}{6} + \frac{33}{6},$$  
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m which reduces to 
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m $$\boxed{10 + 2\sqrt{3}}.$$
