[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m Now we have:
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m \[ 10^{3.2} \cdot 10^{0.5} \cdot 10^{0.3} \cdot 10^{0.2} \cdot 10^{0.1} \]
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m We can use the rule more straightforwardly by recognizing that \(10^{a} \cdot 10^{b} = 10^{a+b}\):
