[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m    \[
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m    (x', y') = (x - h, y - k)
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m    \]
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m    In this case, the points are \((x, y)\) and \((h, k)\).
