[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m 3. **Apply the rotation formula**:
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m    \[
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m    C' = (4, 4)
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m    \]
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m    Substituting the given points into the rotation formula:
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m    \[
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m    C' = (4 - 4, 4 - 1)
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m    \]
