[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m Hint3:  Combine
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m    \begin{align}
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m    & z= \dfrac{1}{3}+ \dfrac{i}{3}
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m    \\ &
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m    & \bar{z}= \dfrac{1}{3}- \dfrac{i}{3}
