[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m Find the number of functions $f : \mathbb{R} \to \mathbb{R}$ such that
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m \[f(x + y) f(x - y) = (f(x) + f(y))^2 - 4x^2 f(y)\]for all real numbers $x$ and $y.$
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m Please reason step by step, and put your final answer within \boxed{{}}.<|im_end|>
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m <|im_start|>assistant
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m We begin by eliminating the $y$ term.  Doing that, we get:
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m $f(x + y) f(x - y)$
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m \begin{align*} & (f(x + y) + f(x - y))^2 - 4x^2 f(y) \\ &= f(x + y)^2 - 2xy f(x + y) + f(x - y)^2 \\ & - 4xy \end{align*}
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m Therefore, we can write:
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m $$f(x+y) = \frac{(f(x+y))^2 - (f(x-y))^2 - 4x^2 f(y)}{2xy}$$
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m Here 
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m \[u = f(x+y)\]
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m \[v = f(x-y)\]
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m and 
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m \begin{align*}
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m f(x+y) &= u \\ f(x-y) &= v.
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m \end{align*}
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m Squaring gives:
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m \[u^2 \equiv v^2 \equiv (uv)^2 - 4x^2 f(y)\]
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m \[u^2 v^2 \equiv (uv)^2 - 4x^2 f(y)\]
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m Since the two equations are the same, it must means that $uv = 0$ or $f(y) = 0$
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m Therefore,
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m \[ f(x + y) = \frac{(uv)^2 } {2xy} \]
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m or,
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m \[ f(x - y) = \frac{(uv)^2 } {2xy}. \]
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m Now,
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m \[ 2 f(x + y) f(y) =  2 \left(\frac{(uv)^2 } {2xy} \right)^2 - 4x^2 f(y) \]
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m \[ 2  \left(\frac{u^2 v^2 } {4xy} \right) = (uv)^2 \left(\frac{1}{10xy} \right) - 4x^2 \]
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m \[ \Rightarrow (\frac{u^2 v^2}{2x})^2  = \frac{1}{10} \]
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m \[ \Rightarrow \frac{xu^2}{2x v} = \frac{1}{10} \]
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m \[ \Rightarrow xu^2 v = \frac{1}{5} \]
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m \[ \Rightarrow x^2 uv = \frac{1}{25} \]
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m \[ \Rightarrow uv = \frac{1}{25x^2} \text{ or } uv = 0 \text{ or } uv = 5
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m \text{S.amazonaws} \times u \times 25x^2 \\ \Rightarrow uv = \frac{1}{25x^2} \text{ or } uv = 0 \text{ or } 5 \text{or} \left \{f : \mathbb{R} \to \mathbb{R} : (\frac{u^2 v^2}{2x}) = (uv)^2 \right \}<|endoftext|>
