[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m Triangle $ABC$ is an obtuse, isosceles triangle. Angle $A$ measures 20 degrees. What is number of degrees in the measure of the largest interior angle of triangle $ABC$?
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m [asy]
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m draw((-20,0)--(0,8)--(20,0)--cycle);
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m label("$20^{\circ}$",(-13,-0.7),NE);
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m label("$A$",(-20,0),W);
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m label("$B$",(0,8),N);
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m label("$C$",(20,0),E);
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m [/asy]
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m Please reason step by step, and put your final answer within \boxed{{}}.<|im_end|>
