[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m    However, the exact calculation of the perimeter involves more complex geometric constructions or algebraic methods, which might not be straightforward without additional assumptions or specific lengths.
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m 
