[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m \[ \text{Area of the larger garden} = 500 \text{ square feet} \]
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m Calculate the amount of fencing used:
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m 
