[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m    \]
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m    Substitute \(x = \frac{3}{5}\) and \(y = \frac{7}{9}\):
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m    \[
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m    \frac{5\left(\frac{3}{5}\right) + 9\left(\frac{7}{9}\right)}{45\left(\frac{3}{5}\right)\left(\frac{7}{9}\right)}
