[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m \[\frac{1 + \sin x - \cos x}{1 + \sin x + \cos x}.\]The answer will be a trigonometric function of some simple function of $x,$ like "$\cos 2x$" or "$\sin (x^3)$".
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m Please reason step by step, and put your final answer within \boxed{{}}.<|im_end|>
