[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m 72 ÷ 6 = 12 (remainder)
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m 72 ÷ 8 = 9 (remainder)
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m 72 ÷ 9 = 8 (remainder)
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m 72 ÷ 10 = 7.2 (remainder)
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m 72 ÷ 12 = 6 (remainder)
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m 72 ÷ 16 = 4.5 (remainder)
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m 72 ÷ 18 = 4 (remainder)
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m 72 ÷ 20 = 3.6 (remainder)
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m From the above, we can see that the divisors of 72 between 5 and 20 are 6 and 8.
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m 
