[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m The given expression is: \(\cos 54^\circ \cos 4^\circ - \cos 36^\circ \cos 86^\circ\).
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m We know some cosine values:
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m \begin{align*}
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m \cos 36^\circ &\approx 0.8090, \\
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m \cos 86^\circ &\approx -0.1045. \\
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m \end{align*}
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m Substituting these values into the expression:
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m \begin{align*}
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m \cos 54^\circ \cos 4^\circ - \cos 36^\circ \cos 86^\circ &= (0.8090) \left( \cos 4^\circ \right) - (-0.1045) \left( \cos 86^\circ \right) \\
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m &= 0.8090 \cos 4^\circ + 0.1045 \cos 86^\circ.
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m \end{align*}
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m Now, calculating the first term $0.8090 \cos 4^\circ$ using the given \(\cos 4^\circ\):
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m 0.8090 \cos 4^\circ \approx 0.8090 \times 0.9659 \approx 0.7869.
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m Thus:
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m 0.8090 \cos 4^\circ = 0.7869.
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m Next, let's consider the second term $-0.1045 \cos 86^\circ$:
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m -0.1045 \cos 86^\circ \approx -0.1045 \times (-0.1045) \approx 0.0108.
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m Therefore:
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m -0.1045 \cos 86^\circ \approx 0.0108.
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m Putting it all together:
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m \begin{align*}
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m \cos 54^\circ \cos 4^\circ - \cos 36^\circ \cos 86^\circ &= 0.7869 + 0.0108 \\
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m &\approx 0.7977.
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m \end{align*}
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m So, the simplified value of the given expression is:
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m \boxed{0.7977}
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m \]<|endoftext|>
