[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m -1-\frac{1}{2}\ln(2)-\frac{1}{4\sqrt{2}+1}+\frac{3}{2(4\cdot2\sqrt{2}+1)^2}x
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m 
