[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m We only have a valid answer to this because (1) Both the remainder's and divisor's degree factors have a higher power than 2, and (2) roots of the divisor don't include the factors themselves, as we noticed above. Therefore, the remainder is $-3$ ($x+3$ is the correct answer). 
