[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m 1. Calculate the original area of the square.
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m 2. Calculate the new area after decreasing the length by 60 and increasing the width by 60.
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m 3. Find the change in area.
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m Step 1: Calculate the original area.
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m The original length is 3491 inches, and the original width is 3491 inches. The formula for area is:
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m Area = Length x Width
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m So, the original area A1 is:
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m A1 = 3491 inches x 3491 inches
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m A1 = 3491 x 3491 inches²
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m A1 = 1,211,708,010 square inches
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m Step 2: Calculate the new area.
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m After decreasing the length by 60 inches and increasing the width by 60 inches, the new length will be reduced by 60 inches, making the new length 3491 - 60 = 3431 inches. The width remains unchanged at 3491 inches. The formula for the new area A2 is:
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m Formula: Area = Length x Width
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m New Area = 3431 inches x 3491 inches
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m New Area = 1,211,708,001 square inches
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m Step 3: Find the change in area.
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m To find the difference in area, subtract the new area from the original area:
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m Change in Area = A1 - A2
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m Change in Area = 1,211,708,010 square inches - 1,211,708,001 square inches
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m Change in Area = 2,999 square inches
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m So, the area decreases by 2,999 square inches.
