[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m We need to find the common ratio \(q\). The common ratio of an arithmetic sequence is given by the ratio of the second term to the first term, or the ratio of the third term to the second term, and so on. Therefore, we can write:
