[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m There is a machine that multiplies by 2 that takes in 2 as input. Moreover, it includes a hardware circuit that can reject any negative or non-integer input, as well as a true/false question, and yes/no signs next to the buttons. Three ways that we could write the PID can be remember as:
