[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m ### Step 4: Identify the appropriate PID unit impulse
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m Since we have two non-linear and parameter-dependent systems, we need a proportional and regulators (PID). A common comparison in control systems engineering is to use proportional feedback with a rate derivative term.
