[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m For simplicity, let's assume we use advanced PID as shown in the question. The PID coefficients \(P\), \(I\), and D will be determined based on the proportional and regulators.
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m ### Step 5: Construct a system
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m The system can be represented by:
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m \[ \begin{cases}
