[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m This means we need to consider the polynomial:
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m \[ y = \frac{(7 + 3)(7 - 7)^5}{(7 - 1)(7 - 7)^n} = \frac{10^5}{6 \cdot (-1)^n} = \frac{100000}{-6 \cdot (-1)^n} = -\frac{25000}{1 \cdot (-1)^n} \]
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m For there to be a hole at \( x = 7 \), both the denominator and the numerator must be zero at \( x = 7 \). Therefore, we must have:
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m \[ -1^6 = -1 \]
