[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m Let $$t=\frac{2}{x-2}$$, then $x=2-t$
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m $$\log_2 \frac{(3t+9)(2-t)+5t-3}{(3t+9)(t-2)}=\log_2 \frac{1}{2}$$
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m $$\Rightarrow 3t^2+6t-5=0$$
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m $$\Rightarrow (2t-1)(2t+5)=0$$
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m $$\Rightarrow x=2-\frac{1}{2},x=5$$
