[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m In the diagram below, we have $AB = 24$ and $\angle ADB =90^\circ$.  If $\sin A = \frac23$ and $\sin C = \frac34$, then what is $BC$?
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m [asy]
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m pair A,B,C,D;
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m A = (0,0);
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m B = (8*sqrt(5),16);
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m D = (8*sqrt(5),0);
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m C = (8*sqrt(5) + 5.3333*sqrt(7),0);
