[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m 3. **Calculate the number of permutations of a set of 6 letters:**
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m    The formula for permutations of \( n \) items is given by:
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m    \[
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m    P(n) = n! \quad \text{(n factorial)}
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m    \]
