[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m ```
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m  = 6a^3 + 92a^2 - 7 - (-7a^3 + a^2 - 7)
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m ```
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m Now, simplify the algebraic expressions containing the minus sign:
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m \[\left (6a^3 - 7a^3 + 92a^2 - a^2\right) - \left (-7 + 7a^3 - 7a^2\right)\]
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m ```
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m  = 6a^3 + 92a^2 - 7 - (-7a^3 + a^2 - 7)
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m ```
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m Now we bring the \(-7\) and \(-7\) in brackets:
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m \[\left (-7 + 6a^3 + 92a^2\right) - \left (-7a^3 + a^2\right)\]
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m ```
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m  = 6a^3 + 92a^2 - 7 - (-7a^3 + a^2)
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m ```
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m Now, combine like terms:
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m \[(6a^3 + 7a^3) - a^2 + (92a^2 - a^2) - 7\]
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m ```python
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m # python code to expand the brackets
