[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m $[ -2 < 4 + 3x ] \cdot 3 < [ 2 ] \cdot 3$
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m This gives us $-\,6 < 3x < 6 =\,2$
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m Secondary stage, we need to get all terms involving $x$ on the left, and all constant terms on the right.
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m So, we can simplify the inequality by dividing all terms by $3$.
