[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m $\{a_n\}$ is a partial product, it is : $a_1=a_0a_0^2$, ..., $a_n=0a_{n-1}a_n^2$ . From the initial value, $a_0=\left(\frac{2}{1}\right)^{1/3}, a_1=\left(\sqrt[19]{2}\right)$, the number of partial products is $19$, the magnitude of the partial product is the square root of the initial value, but then the number of partial products is the cube root of the number, so the member is $2^{1/3}$. It is a multiple of $2^{1/3}$. So the sequence is a null sequence.
