[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m First, we need to evaluate each term individually:
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m $$64^{1/2} = 8$$
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m $$27^{-1/3} = \frac{1}{27^{1/3}}$$
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m $$16^{1/4} = \left(\frac{1}{2}\right)^4$$
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m Now apply these values:
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m $$64^{1/2}\cdot27^{-1/3}\cdot16^{1/4} = 8\cdot(\frac{1}{27^{1/3}})\cdot(\frac{1}{2})^4$$
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m Further simplifying each factor:
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m $$8\cdot(\frac{1}{2})^4 = 8\cdot\frac{1}{16} = \boxed{\frac{8}{16}}$$
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m $$\frac{1}{27^{1/3}} = \frac{1}{3}$$
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m Combine them:
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m $$\frac{8}{16}\cdot\frac{1}{3} = \boxed{\frac{1}{6}}$$
