[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m 2. **Substitute the Second Equation:**
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m    We can substitute the second equation $\sin a + \sin b = \frac{3}{11}$ into the identity. First, square the second equation:
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m    \[
