[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m 1. If $n$ is odd:
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m f(2) = (2)^2 + 1 = 4 + 1 = 5
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m 
