[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m To compute $\cos 300^{\circ}$:
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m 1. Identify the reference angle. The reference angle is the angle that the trigonometric function of an angle creates under the x-axis, with the infinite part of 300 degrees. This angle is 60 degrees, as we can see later.
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m 2. Use the cosine cosine formula. We use the formula:
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m \cos(a) \cos(b) - \sin(a) \sin(b) = \cos(a + b)
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m 3. Here, we will use $a=60^{\circ}$ and $b=300^{\circ}$, which correspond to the reference angle.
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m \cos 60^{\circ} \cos 300^{\circ} - \sin 60^{\circ} \sin 300^{\circ}
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m 4. Calculate $\cos 60^{\circ}$ and $\sin 60^{\circ}$ and use the known value of $\sin 60^{\circ} = \frac{\sqrt{3}}{2}$, since $\cos 60^{\circ} = \frac{1}{2}$.
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m \cos 60^{\circ} = \frac{1}{2}, \quad \sin 60^{\circ} = \frac{\sqrt{3}}{2}
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m 5. Now calculate $\cos 300^{\circ}$ and $\sin 300^{\circ}$. Use the periodicity of the cosine and sine functions:
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m \cos 300^{\circ} = \cos (360^{\circ} - 60^{\circ}) = \cos 60^{\circ}
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m \sin 300^{\circ} = \sin (360^{\circ} - 60^{\circ}) = \sin 60^{\circ}
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m 6. Substitute these values into the formula:
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m \cos 60^{\circ} \cos 300^{\circ} - \sin 60^{\circ} \sin 300^{\circ}
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m 7. Calculate $\cos 300^{\circ}$ and $\sin 300^{\circ}$:
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m \cos 300^{\circ} = \cos (360^{\circ} - 60^{\circ}) = \cos 60^{\circ} = \frac{1}{2}
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m \sin 300^{\circ} = \sin (360^{\circ} - 60^{\circ}) = \sin 60^{\circ} = \frac{\sqrt{3}}{2}
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m 8. Substitute these values into the formula:
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m \cos 60^{\circ} \cos 300^{\circ} - \sin 60^{\circ} \sin 300^{\circ}
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m 9. Now compute the values:
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m \cos 60^{\circ} = \frac{1}{2}, \quad \sin 60^{\circ} = \frac{\sqrt{3}}{2}
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m \cos 300^{\circ} = \frac{1}{2}, \quad \sin 300^{\circ} = \frac{\sqrt{3}}{2}
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m 10. Substitute these values back into the formula:
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m \cos 60^{\circ} \cos 300^{\circ} - \sin 60^{\circ} \sin 300^{\circ}
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m \frac{1}{2} \cdot \frac{1}{2} - \frac{\sqrt{3}}{2} \cdot \frac{\sqrt{3}}{2}
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m \quad
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m Check:
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m \frac{1}{2} \cdot \frac{1}{2} - \frac{\sqrt{3}}{2} \cdot \frac{\sqrt{3}}{2}
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m \quad
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m Rearrange it:
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m \frac{1}{4} - \frac{3}{4}
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m Do the calculations:
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m \frac{1}{4} - \frac{3}{4} = -\frac{2}{4} = -\frac{1}{2}
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m Rearranging, the equation becomes:
