[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m Therefore, 22 must be the only distinct element in the set. This implies that x equals its mode. Likewise, we know that the mean of the ordered set is equal to the median.
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m <br/>
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m Thus, $\dfrac{6 + x+22}{3}=22$.
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m <br/>
