[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m '''
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m Now, we take the highest powers of all prime factors present in the factorizations.
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m - For 2 from the factorizations:
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m '''
