[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m $(x+2)(x^2-4x+3)=(x+2)(x-3)(x-1)$
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m Hence $(5-x)(x-3)(x-1)=0$ leads us to the following possible solutions -2, 3,-1 
