[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m The place value system in base 3 is as follows:
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m - $0$
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m - $3$
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m - $3^2$
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m - $3^3$
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m - ...
