[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m Now that we have the constant of proportionality $k$, we can use it to find $\alpha$ when $\beta = 8$:
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m \alpha \cdot 8 = 18
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m 
