[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m        \]
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m      - The solution goes through with this example.
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m 9. **Implementation with Code:**
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m    We will now use Python to assist in the final solution.
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m 10. **Final Answer:**
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m     Let's complete the code and find the unique number not in the range of \( f \).
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m ```python
