[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m 3. Starting from the first row of the equation $$6 waffles = 5 bras**, we can express waffles as $2 \waffles$, then with the same relationship, by getting 5 bras with 2 waffles: $$2 \waffles = \frac{5}{2}\text{ bras}$$
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m 4. Using waffles as bras, by expression $3$ bras = $1$ fallop, and knowing that there are $11$ deflators, you can find $3$ bras to fill $11$ filleddos: $$11 wineglasses = 3 \cuddles$$
