[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m The sides of this parallelogram measure 7,9, $8y-1$ and $2x+3$ units, consecutively. What is the value of $x+y$?
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m [asy]draw((0,0)--(21,0)--(30,25)--(9,25)--cycle);
