[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m Yes, this can be solved using the following approach:
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m There are a total of 1 * 8 = 8 questions in the quiz, rendered a total total of 8 possible sequences. If the correct sequence were AABBB, there would be 6 combinations:
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m 
