[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m Five friends plan to order 1500 boxes of crackers, $50 each. With an agreed average contribution of $30 per person, what is the average contribution per bonus split? Round the answer to two decimal places if necessary.
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m To determine the average contribution per bonus split, we need to follow these steps:
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m 1. Calculate the total number of boxes of crackers for all five friends.
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m 2. Calculate the total contribution from the five friends.
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m 3. Determine the average contribution per bonus split by dividing the total contribution by the number of bonus splits.
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m First, we calculate the total number of boxes of crackers for all five friends. Since each friend orders 1500 boxes and there are 5 friends:
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m 1500 \text{ boxes/friend} \times 5 \text{ friends} = 7500 \text{ boxes}
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m Next, we calculate the total contribution from the five friends. Since each friend contributes $70 (given as $30 per person times 3 people) and there are 5 friends, the total contribution is:
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m 70 \text{ dollars/friend} \times 5 \text{ friends} = 350 \text{ dollars}
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m Now, we determine the average contribution per bonus split. The total contribution is $350, and there are 5 bonus splits. Therefore, the average contribution per bonus split is:
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m \frac{350 \text{ dollars}}{5 \text{ bonus splits}} = 70 \text{ dollars/bonus split}
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m Thus, the average contribution per bonus split is \boxed{70}.<|endoftext|>
