[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m - **Distance**: 20 miles.
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m - **Desired return distance**: 20 miles (with a public highway).
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m - **Time taken to return**: Time can be calculated using the formula: \( \text{Time} = \frac{\text{Distance}}{\text{Speed}} \)
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m \[
