[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m This is a quadratic equation in terms of \( a \). Solving for \( a \) using the quadratic formula \( a = \frac{-b \pm \sqrt{b^2 - 4ac}}{2a} \) with \( a = 1 \), \( b = -3b \), and \( c = b^2 \):
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m \[
