[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m Given $\mathbf{a} = \begin{pmatrix} -7 \\ 0 \\ 1 \end{pmatrix}$ and $\mathbf{b} = \begin{pmatrix} 4 \\ 2 \\ -1 \end{pmatrix},$ find $\mathbf{a} - 3 \mathbf{b}.$
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m Please reason step by step, and put your final answer within \boxed{{}}.<|im_end|>
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m <|im_start|>assistant
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m To find \(\mathbf{a} - 3 \mathbf{b}\), we need to perform the following calculations:
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m Given:
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m \mathbf{a} = \begin{pmatrix} -7 \\ 0 \\ 1 \end{pmatrix} \quad \text{and} \quad \mathbf{b} = \begin{pmatrix} 4 \\ 2 \\ -1 \end{pmatrix}
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m We need to calculate:
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m \mathbf{a} - 3 \mathbf{b}
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m Step-by-step calculation:
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m 1. Compute \(3 \mathbf{b}\):
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m    \[
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m    3 \mathbf{b} = 3 \begin{pmatrix} 4 \\ 2 \\ -1 \end{pmatrix} = \begin{pmatrix} 3 \cdot 4 \\ 3 \cdot 2 \\ 3 \cdot -1 \end{pmatrix} = \begin{pmatrix} 12 \\ 6 \\ -3 \end{pmatrix}
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m    \]
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m 2. Subtract \(3 \mathbf{b}\) from \(\mathbf{a}\):
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m    \[
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m    \mathbf{a} - 3 \mathbf{b} = \begin{pmatrix} -7 \\ 0 \\ 1 \end{pmatrix} - \begin{pmatrix} 12 \\ 6 \\ -3 \end{pmatrix}
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m    \]
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m 3. Perform the subtraction component-wise:
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m    \[
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m    \begin{pmatrix} -7 \\ 0 \\ 1 \end{pmatrix} - \begin{pmatrix} 12 \\ 6 \\ -3 \end{pmatrix} = \begin{pmatrix} -7 - 12 \\ 0 - 6 \\ 1 - (-3) \end{pmatrix} = \begin{pmatrix} -19 \\ -6 \\ 4 \end{pmatrix}
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m    \]
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m So, the result is:
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m \boxed{\begin{pmatrix} -19 \\ -6 \\ 4 \end{pmatrix}}
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m \]<|endoftext|>
