[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m Step 2: To find the roots of the equation, we will use the quadratic formula:
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m $$t = {-b \pm \sqrt{b^2-4ac}}{ \over 2a}$$
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m Step 3:  In this case, $a = 6$, $b = 41$, and $c = -30$. We now plug in these values into the quadratic formula to find the roots.
