[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m In the diagram below, we have $\sin \angle RPQ = \frac{7}{25}$.  What is $\sin \angle RPS$?
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m [asy]
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m pair R,P,Q,SS;
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m SS = (-2,0);
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m P = (0,0);
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m Q = (2,0);
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m R = rotate(aSin(7/25))*(1.5,0);
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m dot("$S$",SS,S);
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m dot("$Q$",Q,S);
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m dot("$R$",R,N);
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m dot("$P$",P,S);
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m draw(Q--SS);
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m draw(P--R);
