[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m 2. **Compute the discriminant**:
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m    \[
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m    (-11)^2 = 121
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m    \]
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m    \[
