[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m To find the remainder when \(33818^2 + 33819^2 + 33820^2 + 33821^2 + 33822^2\) is divided by 17, we will follow these steps:
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m 1. **Calculate each term modulo 17:**
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m    \[
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m    33818 \mod 17, \quad 33819 \mod 17, \quad 33820 \mod 17, \quad 33821 \mod 17, \quad 33822 \mod 17
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m    \]
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m 2. **Compute the individual moduls:**
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m    - \(33818 \mod 17\)
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m    \[
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m    33818 \div 17 = 1961 \quad \text{(quotient) remainder } 1 \quad \text{so} \quad 33818 \mod 17 = 1
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m    \]
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m    - \(33819 \mod 17\)
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m    \[
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m    33819 \div 17 = 2055 \quad \text{(quotient) remainder } 8 \quad \text{so} \quad 33819 \mod 17 = 8
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m    \]
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m    - \(33820 \mod 17\)
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m    \[
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m    33820 \div 17 = 2048 \quad \text{(quotient) remainder } 4 \quad \text{so} \quad 33820 \mod 17 = 4
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m    \]
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m    - \(33821 \mod 17\)
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m    \[
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m    33821 \div 17 = 2041 \quad \text{(quotient) remainder } 10 \quad \text{so} \quad 33821 \mod 17 = 10
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m    \]
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m    - \(33822 \mod 17\)
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m    \[
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m    33822 \div 17 = 2041 \quad \text{(quotient) remainder } 12 \quad \text{so} \quad 33822 \mod 17 = 12
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m    \]
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m 3. **Sum all the moduls:**
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m    \[
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m    1 + 8 + 4 + 10 + 12 \mod 17
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m    \]
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m 4. **Perform the addition and modulo operation:**
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m    \[
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m    1 + 8 = 9
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m    \]
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m    \[
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m    9 + 4 = 13
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m    \]
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m    \[
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m    13 + 10 = 23
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m    \]
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m    \[
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m    23 + 12 = 35
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m    \]
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m 5. **Find the remainder when the sum is divided by 17:**
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m    \[
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m    35 \mod 17 = 2
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m    \]
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m So, the remainder when \(\boxed{33818^2 + 33819^2 + 33820^2 + 33821^2 + 33822^2}\) is divided by 17 is \(\boxed{2}\).<|endoftext|>
