[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m The coefficient of \(x^{49}\) is obtained by expanding the product and calculating its coefficients. Let's go through this step by step.
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m The polynomial is given by:
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m (x + 1)(x + 3)(x + 5) \dotsm (x + 95)(x + 97)(x + 99).
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m To find the coefficient of \(x^{49}\), we need to consider the terms that consist of the product of four consecutive numbers (since the factor \(x\) eventually disappears after combining all the terms from \(x + 1\) to \(x + 99\)):
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m (x)(x + 3)(x + 5) \dotsm (x + 95)(x + 97)(x + 99).
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m This product will consist of three factors of \(x\) from each pair of consecutive numbers, and two terms of the form \((x + \text{number})\):
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m 1. \((x)(x + 3)(x + 5)\)
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m 2. \((x)(x + 5)(x + 7)\)
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m 3. \((x)(x + 7)(x + 9)\)
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m 4. \((x)(x + 9)(x + 11)\)
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m 5. \((x)(x + 11)(x + 13)\)
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m 6. \((x)(x + 13)(x + 15)\)
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m 7. \((x)(x + 15)(x + 17)\)
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m 8. \((x)(x + 17)(x + 19)\)
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m 9. \((x)(x + 19)(x + 21)\)
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m 10. \((x)(x + 21)(x + 23)\)
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m 11. \((x)(x + 23)(x + 25)\)
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m 12. \((x)(x + 25)(x + 27)\)
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m 13. \((x)(x + 27)(x + 29)\)
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m Now, we will calculate the coefficients for each pair:
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m 1. \(5x \cdot 8x = 40x^2\)
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m 2. \(10x \cdot 9x = 90x^2\)
