[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m $$b - 2 \leq 5 - b$$
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m $$2b \leq 7$$
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m $$b \leq 3.5$$
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m $$b \leq 3.5$$
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m Given $b$ must be greater than $-2$ and less than or equal to 6, and also $b$ must be a valid coordinate, we can conclude that the only possible value of $b$ is $0$ when $b = 3$ or $3.5$. 
