[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m Melvin's boss orders him to unpack all the books and repack them so that there are $40$ books in each box. After packing as many such boxes as possible, Melvin has how many books left over?
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m Please reason step by step, and put your final answer within \boxed{{}}.<|im_end|>
