[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m \log z = \log \left( \frac{-7 \times 10^{10}}{-7 \times 10^6} \right) = 10^10
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m Since \(\log z = \log x\):
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m \log x = 10^{10}
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m 9. Now we solve for \(x\) using:
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m \log x - \log y = 15
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m \log x = 10^{10}
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m x = 10^{10 + 15}
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m \[
