[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m 10. Finally compute \(a\):
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m     \[
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m     a = 10^{15}
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m     \]
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m Thus:
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m a = 10^{15}/10^{15} = 1
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m 
