[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m This means that 73% of the sales were either full letter papers or letter binding pens (not notes or writing pens).
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m Now, we want to find the percentage of sales that were not full letter papers or letter binding pens. 
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m The 73% we just calculated is the combined sales percentage, so the sale that wasn't full letter paper or letter binding pens is:
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m 100\% - 73\% = 27\%
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m \]
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m Putting the step-by-step reasoning into a final answer:
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m 
