[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m By looking at the graph, we can also determine $k = 0$ and $c = 0,$ so the focus of the parabola is at $(0, 0).$
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m Putting everything together, $\boxed{y = \frac{1}{4}x^2 + 0}$ is the vertex form equation of the parabola.
