[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m In $\triangle ABC,$ $AB=AC=25$ and $BC=23.$  Points $D,E,$ and $F$ are on sides $\overline{AB},$ $\overline{BC},$ and $\overline{AC},$ respectively, such that $\overline{DE}$ and $\overline{EF}$ are parallel to $\overline{AC}$ and $\overline{AB},$ respectively.  What is the perimeter of parallelogram $ADEF$?
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m [asy]
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m real r=5/7;
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m pair A=(10,sqrt(28^2-100)),B=origin,C=(20,0),D=(A.x*r,A.y*r);
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m pair bottom=(C.x+(D.x-A.x),C.y+(D.y-A.y));
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m pair E=extension(D,bottom,B,C);
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m pair top=(E.x+D.x,E.y+D.y);
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m pair F=extension(E,top,A,C);
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m draw(A--B--C--cycle^^D--E--F);
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m dot(A^^B^^C^^D^^E^^F);
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m label("$A$",A,NW);
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m label("$B$",B,SW);
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m label("$C$",C,SE);
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m label("$D$",D,W);
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m label("$E$",E,S);
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m label("$F$",F,dir(0));
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m [/asy]
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m Please reason step by step, and put your final answer within \boxed{{}}.<|im_end|>
