[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m (B) Circle
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m (C) Parabola
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m (D) Ellipse
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m (E) Hyperbola
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m 
