[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m To solve this problem, we can follow these steps:
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m 1. Determine the number of women and men on the cruise ship:
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m    - Total number of men and women = 2000
