[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m To find the value of \( x \) such that \(\sqrt{x + \sqrt{x + \sqrt{x + \ldots}}} = 5\), we can start by expressing the equation in a form that allows us to identify \( x \) more easily.
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m 
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m Given:
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m \[
[36m(main_task pid=1078428)[0m \sqrt{x + \sqrt{x + \sqrt{x + \ldots}}} = 5
